{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "nav",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Movement｜结构图\n当前类和权威边界；步态/转身时序见 [[GGYGO_流程_移动与位移.canvas|流程图]]，曲线读取见 [[GGYGO_流程_动画曲线处理.canvas|子图]]。[[Movement/结构|结构文档]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 1500,
      "height": 145,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "input",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## UGGYGOHeroComponent\n`Input_Move(Value)` → 连续轴值进入 CMC。\n`Input_ForceWalkPressed/Released()` → CMC ForceWalk 请求。\n`RequestRunOnNextMove()` 为 CMC 预留接口，GA_Dodge 仅占位、尚无调用方。[[Input/结构]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 280,
      "width": 390,
      "height": 215,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "set",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## UGGYGOMovementSet\n`GetSpeedForGait(Gait)` → Walk/Run 固定速度兜底。\n`WalkToRunHoldSeconds` → 持续 Walk 升 Run，默认 1.5 秒。\n`bUseCurveDrivenSpeed` / `RootMotionScale` / `MaxCurveDrivenSpeed` → 当前曲线规则；转身阈值也在这里。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 620,
      "width": 390,
      "height": 235,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "cmc",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## UGGYGOCharacterMovementComponent\n`TickComponent()` → Super 前采曲线。\n`UpdateCharacterStateBeforeMovement()` → Walk 计时升 Run、ForceWalk、转身/刹停。\n`GetMaxSpeed()` → 曲线或步态速度；ForceWalk 封顶 Walk。\n`PhysicsRotation()` → 转身 YawDelta。\n`SetMovementSet()` → 注入配置并重置移动记忆。",
      "x": 530,
      "y": 340,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 305,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "sampler",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## FGGYGOAnimCurveSampler\n`Sample(AnimInstance, dt, OutMotion)` → 读 Speed、位置、路程、方向和 Yaw。\n`ResetBaseline()` → 避免切段/失去 Mesh 后跳变。\n[[Animation/曲线处理]]",
      "x": 1100,
      "y": 230,
      "width": 410,
      "height": 250,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "rms",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## FRootMotionSource_GGYGOCurve\n`PrepareRootMotion()` → Speed/Direction 按入口 BaseYaw 转世界速度，交 CMC RootMotion。\n`NetSerialize()` → 复制基准角、缩放和结束策略。",
      "x": 1100,
      "y": 580,
      "width": 410,
      "height": 245,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "saved",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## FSavedMove_GGYGO\n`SetMoveFor()` → 保存步态、Walk 计时、ForceWalk、输入边沿、转身与 CurveMotion。\n`PrepMoveFor()` → 重演前恢复。\n`CanCombineWith()` → 阻止不兼容 move 合并；Custom 位传递步态/ForceWalk。",
      "x": 530,
      "y": 830,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 240,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "frame",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## FGGYGOAnimationStateFrame\nCMC 发布输入、步态与曲线转身语义；AnimBP 只读选择表现。[[Animation/结构]]",
      "x": 1100,
      "y": 940,
      "width": 410,
      "height": 205,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "contract",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 移动权威接口链\nHeroComponent::Input_Move → Pawn::AddMovementInput；ForceWalk 输入 → CMC::SetForceWalkRequested。\nCMC::UpdateCharacterStateBeforeMovement 连续 Walk 满 1.5 秒升 Run；AnimationStateCapture 发布 Gait，ZZZ 兼容层映射为 GaitBlendY，ABP_Pyrios.WalkRun BlendSpace X 轴消费。\nCMC::TickComponent → Sampler::Sample(AnimInstance, dt, CurveMotion)；GetMaxSpeed/PhysicsRotation 消费，RMS::PrepareRootMotion 供动作段位移。\nFSavedMove_GGYGO::SetMoveFor/PrepMoveFor + CanCombineWith 保证预测重放边界。MotionProfile 为目标设计，当前不可作为已实现 CMC 输入。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1240,
      "width": 1450,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "movement-test-map",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1650,
      "width": 1450,
      "height": 250,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "## L_Movement_Test｜可直接 Play 的验证场景\n`/Game/Map/L_Movement_Test`：1000 × 1000 m Cube，顶面 Z=0，BlockAll / WorldStatic；世界坐标 5 m 网格。\nWorld Settings → BP_GameMode → DA_Experience_Default → DA_Pawn_Pyrios；中央 PlayerStart=(0,0,150) cm。\n现有 IA_Move → HeroComponent → CMC；地图只提供生成环境和地面碰撞。\n38 秒 PIE / 4513 帧全部接地，Walk→Run 与 TurnBack 已观测。[[Movement/移动测试关卡|配置与证据]] · [[GameFeature/结构|装配接口]]"
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
